Description:
Scriptpack for other mods.

Provides functionality that can be used by other mod makers.
See mod.io mod description for how to use.

**Favorable Need system**

Can attach to any NeedSpec, 'opposite' of the punitive needs system.

{
  "NeedSpec": { .. },
  "FavorableNeedSpec": {
    "Favors": [
      { "Id": "CarryingCapacity", "MultiplierDelta": 0.3 }
    ]
  }
}

**Water Sources**

There's three attachable specs, one making it ignore strength modifiers, one making drought half strength only and one making it ignore any contamination changes.

**WhitepawsPatchSpec**

can change swimming penalty and water units per voxel from json.
